@startuml Sequence Diagram - Webhook Notification
title Escenario 4 - Notificacion Webhook (Simulator API)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam titleFontSize 11
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 10
skinparam ActorFontSize 10
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam NoteFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceGroupFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceDividerFontSize 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #666666

participant "Tester / QA\n(o Trigger Interno)" as Tester
participant "Simulator API\n(Fastify)" as SimAPI
participant "Signature\nGenerator" as Generator
participant "Webhook\nDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "Comercio\n(Webhook Endpoint)" as Comercio
participant "SDK KitPagos" as SDK

Tester -> SimAPI : POST\n/v1/sim/webhooks/\ntrigger\n{gateway,\ntransactionId}
SimAPI -> Generator : generate(subject)
Generator --> SimAPI : OutgoingWebhook
SimAPI -> Dispatcher : deliver(webhook)
Dispatcher -> Comercio : POST {webhookUrl}(\nrawPayload,\nheaders)

Comercio -> SDK : validateWebhook(\nrawPayload, headers,\noptions?)

alt firma valida
  SDK --> Comercio : WebhookEvent
  opt Webhook liviano (Mercado Pago: solo ID)
    Comercio -> SDK : getPaymentStatus(\ngatewayTransactionId)
    SDK --> Comercio : Transaction (estado consolidado)
  end
  Comercio -> Comercio : actualizar orden interna
else firma invalida
  SDK -->x Comercio : throw\nKitPagosError(\nWEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_\nINVALID)
  Comercio -->x Comercio : descartar evento
end

note over Tester, SDK
  Wompi: header X-Event-Checksum + body signature.checksum (SHA-256)
  Rapyd: header signature (Base64 HMAC-SHA256 sobre
  url_path+salt+timestamp+access_key+secret_key+body); salt/timestamp/access_key
  en headers separados
  Mercado Pago: header x-signature ts=...,v1=... (HMAC-SHA256)
  Kushki: mecanismo de firma no documentado en fuentes oficiales; SDK y simulador
  informan esta limitacion.
end note

@enduml
